        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy and relaxing <strong>mini golf game that floats right on your desktop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play while you work, watch videos, or just take a break - your course stays peacefully in view, no fullscreen or window needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy quick, satisfying putts any time you need a breather. The game runs smoothly above your background, so it never gets in the way of your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new floating courses, collect fun themes, and make your desktop feel like a mini golf paradise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏝️ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>floating mini golf course</strong> that sits right on your desktop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and cozy gameplay</strong> designed for short breaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 levels</strong> for you to play, all with their own obstacles and challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, intuitive controls</strong> - click, aim, and putt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No fullscreen or clutter</strong> - play while doing other tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new themes and courses</strong> as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth physics and ambient sound</strong> for a chill experience</p></li></ul>",
